docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:278:- [x] gate formalization on proof-readiness score and explicit blocker lists
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:283:- a case can be complaint-ready but not proof-ready, and that difference is explicit
