docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:312:- [x] expose `support_lane_label_counts` and `support_quality_counts` aggregated across claims in `build_intake_case_review_summary` (inside `claim_support_packet_summary`)
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:313:- [x] surface lane distribution and quality chips in claim_support_review.html, document.html, and optimization_trace.html
