docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:344:- [x] add Phase 1 metrics for chronology completeness, contradiction count, duplicate-question rate, and proof-lead density
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:345:- [x] add Phase 2 metrics for support sufficiency, support quality, and proof readiness
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:346:- [x] add fixtures for retaliation, discrimination, housing, and consumer scenarios with distinct proof burdens
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_EXECUTION_BACKLOG.md:347:- [x] update critic prompts or scoring rubrics to reward question relevance and proof progress instead of verbosity
