docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md:163:- `proof_leads`: include owner, availability, expected format, retrieval path, authenticity risk, privacy risk, element targets, fact targets, and priority.
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md:166:- `timeline_anchors`: capture exact dates, ranges, approximations, and sequence-only anchors.
