docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md:341:### 1A. Derive temporal evidence tasks from event gaps, not only packet status
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md:343:The current Phase 2 task builder in [mediator/mediator.py](../mediator/mediator.py) correctly marks chronology-specific work when packet elements carry temporal-rule metadata. The next step is to ground those tasks in the same event ledger created during intake.
docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md:345:Each temporal evidence task should additionally carry:
