docs/INTAKE_EVIDENCE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md:591:That slice uses the implementation that already exists, closes the remaining authored-ledger gap, and creates a cleaner handoff from intake chronology to evidence execution, review, drafting, theorem export, and proof consumers.
